sequenceDiagram
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant SA as SchemaAgent
    participant LLM as GPT-4o
    participant DB as Database

    Orch->>SA: run(session)
    SA->>SA: Build system prompt:\nYou are an API schema expert.\nOutput valid OpenAPI-compatible JSON.
    SA->>SA: Build user prompt with extracted_schema content
    SA->>LLM: chat_json(system, user, max_tokens=4096)
    LLM-->>SA: JSON response

    alt Valid JSON returned
        SA->>SA: Parse and normalize response
        SA->>SA: snake_case field names
        SA->>SA: Fill missing version = 1.0.0
        SA->>SA: Ensure each endpoint has input_schema
        SA->>DB: UPDATE session\ndraft_api = {name, description, base_url,\nversion, auth_type,\nendpoints with name path method input_schema output_schema}
        SA-->>Orch: done → CONFIDENCE_SCORING
    else LLM error or rate limit
        SA->>DB: UPDATE state = FAILED\nerror_log.append({step, error})
        SA-->>Orch: failed
    end
